-- UNGRADED EVIDENCE (this gate executes only `cmd:` and `control:`).
--
-- THE SEVERITY PROBE, and the post-drain guard's other half. It is the S0 this
-- defect is NOT: a body that is ill-typed under its own interface's declaration and
-- well-typed only under the same-spelled OTHER one. `medaka check` REJECTS it
-- (measured — see claim.txt), so the wrong-signature attribution never becomes a
-- wrong ACCEPTANCE on the check path; that is why #1647 is S1 and not S0.
